---
description: Standards for technical chapters
globs:
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - "case-studies/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Every technical chapter must explain:
- the problem
- assumptions
- mechanism
- guarantees
- failure modes
- performance
- alternatives
- operational concerns
- security
- cost
- interview relevance

Avoid shallow summaries.

Use examples, calculations, diagrams, failure scenarios, and production
implementations.

Define acronyms on first use.

Do not claim universal best practices. Explain decision criteria.
